{"seq":5,"slug":"astronomy","title":"天文学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy","introMarkdown":"# 天文学 简介\n\n天文学是人类最古老的自然科学之一，它以宇宙中的天体和天体系统为研究对象，探索从行星到恒星、从星系到整个可观测宇宙的结构、演化和物理本质。借助望远镜、探测器和计算模拟等工具，天文学家正在回答一些最根本的问题：宇宙如何起源？恒星如何诞生和死亡？除了地球之外是否还存在生命？\n\n自学者进入天文学领域时会发现，现代天文学已经远远超越了肉眼观星的浪漫阶段，成为一门高度依赖物理学和数学的精确科学。恒星的光谱分析需要量子力学知识，宇宙膨胀的描述需要广义相对论，星系动力学的理解需要引力理论和统计力学。因此，物理学的基础对于深入天文学至关重要。\n\n第一章**观测天文学**介绍天文观测的基本工具和方法，从光学望远镜到射电阵列，从可见光到X射线和引力波，展示人类如何用越来越多的\"感官\"感知宇宙。第二章**恒星天体物理**追踪恒星从诞生到死亡的完整生命史，揭示太阳等恒星的能量来源和内部结构。第三章**星系与宇宙学**将视野从单个恒星扩展到银河系、星系群和整个宇宙的大尺度结构，探讨宇宙的起源和命运。第四章**行星科学**关注太阳系的形成和行星的物理特征，以及系外行星的探测和宜居性问题。\n\n建议从观测天文学入手，在建立对天文现象的直观认知后再深入理论分析。如果条件允许，使用小型望远镜进行实际观测，能极大地增强学习的体验感和动力。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"observational-astronomy","title":"观测天文学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy/observational-astronomy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"celestial-coordinates","title":"天球坐标系","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy/observational-astronomy/celestial-coordinates"},{"seq":2,"slug":"telescopes-detectors","title":"望远镜与探测器","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy/observational-astronomy/telescopes-detectors"},{"seq":3,"slug":"spectral-analysis","title":"光谱分析","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy/observational-astronomy/spectral-analysis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"stellar-astrophysics","title":"恒星天体物理","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy/stellar-astrophysics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stellar-structure","title":"恒星结构","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy/stellar-astrophysics/stellar-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stellar-evolution","title":"恒星演化","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy/stellar-astrophysics/stellar-evolution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"compact-objects","title":"致密天体","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy/stellar-astrophysics/compact-objects"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"galactic-cosmology","title":"星系与宇宙学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy/galactic-cosmology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"milky-way","title":"银河系","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy/galactic-cosmology/milky-way"},{"seq":2,"slug":"galaxies","title":"星系","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy/galactic-cosmology/galaxies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cosmology","title":"宇宙学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy/galactic-cosmology/cosmology"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"planetary-science","title":"行星科学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy/planetary-science","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"solar-system","title":"太阳系","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy/planetary-science/solar-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"exoplanets","title":"系外行星","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy/planetary-science/exoplanets"},{"seq":3,"slug":"astrobiology","title":"天体生物学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/astronomy/planetary-science/astrobiology"}]}]}